ug’ın yemeğe olan aşırı düşkünlüğüne, Carrie’nin pahalı elbiselere karşı tutkusuna rağmen birbirlerine olan aşkları, karşılaştıkları her türlü çıkmazı aşmalarını sağlıyor.\",\"cast\":\"Kevin James, Leah Remini, Jerry Stiller, Victor Williams, Patton Oswalt, Gary Valentine\",\"director\":\"Michael J. Weithorn, David Litt\",\"genre\":\"Komedi\",\"releaseDate\":\"1998-09-21\",\"release_date\":\"1998-09-21\",\"last_modified\":\"1780670593\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/xF4zSVyrOBO60Lwu2wDN0dBjEgk.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sdvd6l9kffMrlaLy7iCqaQNMCL6.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/eXUeRC86hiXhGvJIiibXsc5q8Bj.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/a5tZsJK2HiRdYCZ61tC6INBSvND.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9XFEuEDqnM5gYV4dq2wlxYbMW1b.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"kDfhZTKu5XE\",\"tmdb\":\"4238\",\"episode_run_time\":\"25\",\"category_id\":\"832\",\"category_ids\":[832]},{\"num\":102,\"name\":\"Night Shift for Cuties (2026) TR\",\"series_id\":13872,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/e8Hze00U0XmIRd6IXxP1Egdqw2u.jpg\",\"plot\":\"\",\"cast\":\"Shenina Cinnamon, Nadya Syarifa, Emir Mahira, Gabrielle Novangeline, 백서라, Park Nam, Sunny Soon, Ersa Mayori\",\"director\":\"Monica Vanesa Tedja\",\"genre\":\"Komedi / Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-04\",\"release_date\":\"2026-06-04\",\"last_modified\":\"1780585601\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"ZSe_5i--ZPU\",\"tmdb\":\"315596\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"832\",\"category_ids\":[832]},{\"num\":103,\"name\":\"The Witness (2026) TR\",\"series_id\":13871,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/zz99X2bWxpwys6Y4Ew7YltKKtqr.jpg\",\"plot\":\"\",\"cast\":\"Jordan Bolger, Max Fincham, Neil Maskell, Kevin Eldon, Jahsaiah Williams, Kerry Godliman, Jon Pointing, James Dryden\",\"director\":\"Rob Williams\",\"genre\":\"Dram / Su