ur Durmaz, Elçin Afacan, Müge Bayramoğlu, Sanem Çelik\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Dram / Komedi\",\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-15\",\"release_date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"last_modified\":\"1778862936\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/6HEPZCIdTOw2pQvagkZU3fnKyr6.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/aPX8D912UTiy6TttEaQg0wGPTDT.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mYb69gMubyoWswqmRNhb9ntOXT1.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"322554\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"587\",\"category_ids\":[587]},{\"num\":135,\"name\":\"Legends (2026) TR 4K HDR\",\"series_id\":13814,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/dGienbU1xNZJcbY8i8ubJusjDwD.jpg\",\"plot\":\"90’ların Britanyası\'nda uyuşturucu sokakları istila ederken bir grup devlet memuru, çeteleri çökertmek için gizli bir göreve gönderilir.\",\"cast\":\"Tom Burke, Steve Coogan, Tom Hughes, Charlotte Ritchie, Hayley Squires, Douglas Hodge, Aml Ameen, Jasmine Blackborow\",\"director\":\"Neil Forsyth\",\"genre\":\"Aksiyon & Macera / Suç / Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-07\",\"release_date\":\"2026-05-07\",\"last_modified\":\"1778861807\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4CtOMphAmfHJ6cztlAYjkdStkHP.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4xD586CRFvJgqgGwj9gK5wdnaUi.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1IaJAvQvUpBXGX4oW2Bpwfp9e8D.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/obhorQQ4lzLZFOYcOrJyGMVP9Yc.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5ov6nRcuRhyeDenFK8csyMgBUs0.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"VL1wuCh8IV4\",\"tmdb\":\"262280\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"832\",\"category_ids\":[832]},{\"num\":136,\"name\":\"Berlin ve Kakımlı Kadın (2026) TR\",\"series_id\":13812,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/3uhJ3AHKxSsEWe1BUG9pV0bpqna.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Yeni bir soygun için avuçları kaşınan Berlin, ekibini Sevilla\'da toplar ve 