600_and_h900_bestv2/bCoLLuCXN4crruP5tPzagoTb2WH.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Mira\'nın kusursuz giden hayatı, kocasının boşanma kararıyla bir anda tuzla buz olur. Beklemediği bu kararın ardından yeniden ayağa kalkmak zorundadır.\",\"cast\":\"Nehir Erdoğan, Yiğit Özşener, Nezaket Erden\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-13\",\"release_date\":\"2026-03-13\",\"last_modified\":\"1783435965\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ypFjs8KIZNlk5uJcBwKq03YjQbx.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/8JZdwnnwLPu3l7zCzw9CivHG5ni.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/hu3JUAFgWvYII9I5gTDZbdWC0yp.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/e6Wz2KGinBzyUc0zCRaoUlvjiyH.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"316474\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"151\",\"category_ids\":[151]},{\"num\":197,\"name\":\"That Night (2026) TR\",\"series_id\":13635,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/2N0zVirrHWkNPQGEBcXVIqj5BKJ.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Genç, naif ve bekâr bir anne, tatil için gittiği bir adada bir cinayet olayına karışınca ablaları yardımına koşar. Ama durumu daha da zora sokmaktan başka işe yaramayacaklardır.\",\"cast\":\"Clara Galle, Claudia Salas, Paula Usero, Null García, Raidher Díaz, Gabriel Polanco\",\"director\":\"Jason George\",\"genre\":\"Suç / Dram / Gizem\",\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-13\",\"release_date\":\"2026-03-13\",\"last_modified\":\"1773490282\",\"rating\":\"5\",\"rating_5based\":\"2.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lreax2U5xDNekHdAlfLARPC4Oto.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/j3kWOoVqzeYozRdp1wKj3oCwM1x.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fKiXFcOG5iGdwNm23IVXuqyFynH.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/1uJPX5gktRG5RQYiVzwlOFNWWiP.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"283673\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"832\",\"category_ids\":[832]},{\"num\":198,\"name\":\"ONE PIECE (2023) TR 4K HDR\",\"series_id\":