0/9iCsTW6P8rETcMjeYERa3SwbnTk.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"B7RRBoGsydg\",\"tmdb\":\"280976\",\"episode_run_time\":\"35\",\"category_id\":\"832\",\"category_ids\":[832]},{\"num\":435,\"name\":\"Walter Erkekleriyle Hayatım (2023) TR\",\"series_id\":12900,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/aLnOGWOCrNHlMCPOCm2rYOuwgQn.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Bir trajediyle hayatı altüst olan bir genç kız, küçük kasabada yaşayan vasisinin geniş ailesinin yanına taşınır. Orada hayatla, umutla ve dostlukla ilgili yeni dersler alacaktır.\",\"cast\":\"Nikki Rodriguez, Noah LaLonde, Ashby Gentry, Johnny Link, Corey Fogelmanis, Connor Stanhope, Sarah Rafferty, Marc Blucas\",\"director\":\"Melanie Halsall\",\"genre\":\"Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-07\",\"release_date\":\"2023-12-07\",\"last_modified\":\"1786022591\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5WUsnqUm7xbY3oSwumSLfjyyax.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sR7MmdQnjngsTlDmLtrGOQ9dOsv.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/oCXAXxPAj4VH35FPvO1Trog4imV.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zhqKK2jLRkuIe0XuVRhgqIauAvT.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3YeuVlc1vnggNU99XQEO5PebJ1P.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"pHIXtOrHF80\",\"tmdb\":\"199001\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"832\",\"category_ids\":[832]},{\"num\":436,\"name\":\"Barbie Mysteries The Great Horse Chase (2024) TR\",\"series_id\":12899,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/zKfE4AevCL8RjfcrhfJZat5vWTb.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Yakın arkadaşlar Brooklyn ve Malibu, seyahat yayınlarını gizemli yayınlara dönüştürür ve dünyanın dört bir yanındaki gizemleri çözerken yaşadıkları maceraları paylaşır.\",\"cast\":\"Abby Trott, Diamond White\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Animasyon / Çocuklar\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-11-01\",\"release_date\":\"2024-11-01\",\"last_modified\":\"1756401116\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.o