M.jpg\",\"plot\":\"A horror thriller about Gautham, a stranded urbanite and his three unlikely companions who brave an eerie village to rescue his missing family in one night.\",\"cast\":\"Arya, John Kokken, Adukalam Naren, Muthukumar, Divya Pillai, Baby Aazhiya, Thalaivasal Vijay, George Mariyan\",\"director\":\"Milind Rau\",\"genre\":\"Mystery / Sci-Fi & Fantasy / Action & Adventure\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-24\",\"release_date\":\"2023-11-24\",\"last_modified\":\"1701421105\",\"rating\":\"5\",\"rating_5based\":\"2.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"MreqwusrMjc\",\"tmdb\":\"200879\",\"episode_run_time\":\"42\",\"category_id\":\"464\",\"category_ids\":[464]},{\"num\":1857,\"name\":\"The Lions of Sicily\",\"series_id\":10103,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/rsP3NpgqNaJTdEduwFzd4dgukMx.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Follow brothers Paolo and Ignazio, two small spice merchants who have escaped from a Calabria stuck in the past and in search of social redemption. In Sicily they invent a future, turning a small, run-down shop into a flourish business activity that young Vincenzo, with his revolutionary ideas, will transform into an economic empire.\",\"cast\":\"Michele Riondino, Miriam Leone, Donatella Finocchiaro, Vinicio Marchioni, Eduardo Scarpetta, Paolo Briguglia, Ester Pantano, Adele Cammarata\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-25\",\"release_date\":\"2023-10-25\",\"last_modified\":\"1701420884\",\"rating\":\"6\",\"rating_5based\":\"3\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"Dnf6OpRy30k\",\"tmdb\":\"205482\",\"episode_run_time\":\"400\",\"category_id\":\"464\",\"category_ids\":[464]},{\"num\":1858,\"name\":\"The Interpreter of Silence\",\"series_id\":10102,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/xb6VWblBTczwFdpPfICUMauFcys.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Eva Bruhns\'tan SS subaylarının duruşmasında tercümanlık yapması istendiğinde nişanlanmak üzeredir. Ailesi ve müstakbel nişanlısı onu vazgeçirmeye çalışsa da o içgüdülerinin peşinden gider ve işi kabul eder. Çok geçmeden duruşmayla hayal edebileceğinden çok daha kişisel bir bağı olduğunu fark eder.\",\"cast\":\"Katharina Stark, Anke Engelke, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Thomas Prenn, Ricarda Seifried, Ares Kloß, Heiner Lauterbach, Max von der Groeben\",\"director\":\"Annette Hess\",\"genre\":\"Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-15\",\"release_date\":\"2023-11-15\",\"last_modified\":\"1701420815\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"NsfnWX5nTeg\",\"tmdb\":\"220374\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"744\",\"category_ids\":[744]},{\"num\":1859,\"name\":\"Great Expectations\",\"series_id\":10093,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/izd70v2VS8SxGvnKxDpb65Q5Bx8.jpg\",\"plot\":\"The coming-of-age story of Pip, an orphan who yearns for a greater lot in life, until a twist of fate and the evil machinations of the mysterious and eccentric Miss Havisham shows him a dark world of possibilities. Under the great expectations placed upon him, Pip will have to work out the true cost of this new world and whether it will truly make him the man he wishes to be.\",\"cast\":\"Olivia Colman, Fionn Whitehead, Ashley Thomas, Johnny Harris, Shalom Brune-Franklin, Hayley Squires, Owen McDonnell, Trystan Gravelle\",\"director\":\"Steven Knight\",\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-26\",\"release_date\":\"2023-03-26\",\"last_modified\":\"1701419582\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"HtxjnBvIi78\",\"tmdb\":\"157972\",\"episode_run_time\":\"58\",\"category_id\":\"464\",\"category_ids\":[464]},{\"num\":1860,\"name\":\"Culprits\",\"series_id\":10088,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/gOo5KW8NAvtZdX5jdwnCTYTTpjB.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Family man Joe Petrus is living the American dream with his fiancé and step-kids. However, unbeknownst to them, Joe was involved in a mysterious crime three years ago and now his dangerous past is about to catch up with him. When a killer starts targeting the crew behind the crime, Joe realizes it\'s only a matter of time before his family is targeted. He returns to London to track down his old gang and find out who is coming after them.\",\"cast\":\"Nathan Stewart-Jarrett, Gemma Arterton, Eddie Izzard, Kirby Howell-Baptiste, Niamh Algar, Kamel ElBasha, Tara Abboud, Ned Dennehy\",\"director\":\"J Blakeson\",\"genre\":\"Crime / Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-08\",\"release_date\":\"2023-11-08\",\"last_modified\":\"1711531699\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"JFEs8MngEkM\",\"tmdb\":\"201076\",\"episode_run_time\":\"55\",\"category_id\":\"464\",\"category_ids\":[464]},{\"num\":1861,\"name\":\"A Murder at the End of the World TR\",\"series_id\":10053,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/1mWCXJefbNU1E2XPJVM2vejMSZO.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Z kuşağından amatör hafiye ve teknoloji meraklısı hacker Darby Hart, uzak bir yerde düzenlenen bir inzivaya davet edilir ancak konuklardan biri ölü bulunduğunda Darby, katil başka bir can daha almadan önce bunun bir cinayet olduğunu kanıtlamak için yeteneklerini kullanmak zorundadır.\",\"cast\":\"Emma Corrin, Brit Marling, Harris Dickinson, Alice Braga, Joan Chen, Raúl Esparza, Jermaine Fowler, Ryan J. Haddad\",\"director\":\"Brit Marling, Zal Batmanglij\",\"genre\":\"Gizem / Dram / Suç\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-14\",\"release_date\":\"2023-11-14\",\"last_modified\":\"1709219755\",\"rating\":\"9\",\"rating_5based\":\"4.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"Y84oBoHpqNY\",\"tmdb\":\"134095\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"744\",\"category_ids\":[744]},{\"num\":1862,\"name\":\"Kod Adı: Kırlangıç (2023) TR TABII TV\",\"series_id\":10014,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/zCdzrmQL1GKy7bsj2gh5t3wxHS6.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Aynı mahallede yaşayan çocukların ortak merakı teknolojidir. Drone tasarlamak için bir araya gelen çocuklara yardım edenler de olur, onları engellemeye çalışan kötüler de…\",\"cast\":\"Serkan Şenalp, Gizem Arıkan, Korhan Herduran, Mine Teber, Ayhan Taş, Zeynep Kankonde, Cemil Şahin, Eray Kaman\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Aksiyon & Macera\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-12\",\"release_date\":\"2023-11-12\",\"last_modified\":\"1771537985\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/s3Slt9H4axfWuuatsN9HSGhLu26.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"238522\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"587\",\"category_ids\":[587]},{\"num\":1863,\"name\":\"Special Ops: Lioness (2023) TR\",\"series_id\":9873,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/rXCzevakJoAN1qnZY0nAQPSLVRv.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Gerçek hayatta da var olan bir CIA programına dayanan hikaye, bir terör örgütünü içeriden çökertmeye yardım etmek için CIA\'nın Lioness Engagement Team ekibine katılmak üzere işe alınan kaba ama tutkulu genç bir Denizci olan Cruz Manuelos\'u (Laysla De Oliveira) takip ediyor. Zoe Saldana, kadın gizli ajanlarını sahadaki tehlikeli görevlere hazırlamak için eğitmek, yönetmek ve onlara liderlik etmekle görevli Lioness programının istasyon şefi Joe rolünde izleyici karşısına çıkacak. Nicole Kidman siyaset oyunu oynayarak uzun bir kariyer elde etmiş olan kıdemli CIA amiri Kaitlyn Meade\'i, Morgan Freeman ise ABD Dışişleri Bakanı Edwin Mullins\'i canlandırıyor.\",\"cast\":\"Zoe Saldaña, Laysla De Oliveira, Dave Annable, Jill Wagner, LaMonica Garrett, James Jordan, Austin Hébert, Jonah Wharton\",\"director\":\"Taylor Sheridan\",\"genre\":\"Dram / Savaş & Politik\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-23\",\"release_date\":\"2023-07-23\",\"last_modified\":\"1734452041\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sa9vB0xb3OMU6iSMkig8RBbdESq.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3Udwq6W7y4AIsuJDXV2YwowZ1gQ.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4K5Jdry2gZj5XbomCa0H56g9XCs.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w