ccinini, Diego De Paula\",\"director\":\"Gabriel Nicoli\",\"genre\":\"Comedy / Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-09\",\"release_date\":\"2022-11-09\",\"last_modified\":\"1673956696\",\"rating\":\"6\",\"rating_5based\":\"3\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"157664\",\"episode_run_time\":\"30\",\"category_id\":\"464\",\"category_ids\":[464]},{\"num\":2358,\"name\":\"The French Mans EU\",\"series_id\":5642,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/aaPMTCyw0I0b12OqUF1oqiKH6TV.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Vincent Piquet and Alban Burne, two losers, see their dull lives shattered when, following a misunderstanding, they uncover a conspiracy and find themselves caught up in the world of organized crime. It’s the start of a crazy and chaotic journey filled with peril and intrigue. However, even as they try desperately to save their lives, they never stop bickering.\",\"cast\":\"François Damiens, Vincent Dedienne\",\"director\":\"Chloé Marçais, Fred Scotlande\",\"genre\":\"Comedy / Action & Adventure\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-19\",\"release_date\":\"2022-10-19\",\"last_modified\":\"1673956572\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"136135\",\"episode_run_time\":\"30\",\"category_id\":\"464\",\"category_ids\":[464]},{\"num\":2359,\"name\":\"The Files of Young Kindaichi\",\"series_id\":5641,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/bFTzFjKNAMddnYiLtb3teDmb7ba.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Kindaichi Hajime is a high school student and a private detective with an IQ of 180. He solves murder cases that are riddled with difficult clues. Kindaichi Hajime works with his childhood friend Nanase Miyuki and Kenmochi Isamu. Kenmochi Isamu is now the chief inspector of the Tokyo Metropolitan Police Department.\",\"cast\":\"Shunsuke Michieda, Moka Kamishiraishi, Ikki Sawamura, Iwasaki Taisho\",\"director\":\"Hisashi Kimura, Ryuichi Inomata, Syunpei Maruya\",\"genre\":\"Drama / Mystery\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-24\",\"rel