e_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2850,\"name\":\"Dahaad\",\"series_id\":6303,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/wIAP6sogsPWSEYxyNj6xUsj5VoU.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Bir dizi kadın, gizemli koşullarda umumi tuvaletlerde ölü bulununca, komiser yardımcısı Anjali Bhaati\'ye olayları soruşturma görevi verilir. Durum aydınlanmaya başlayınca Anjali, bunların intihar değil, serbestçe gezen bir seri katilin işi olduğundan şüphelenir. Ve deneyimli bir suçluyla alt tabakadan bir polis arasında kaçma-kovalamaca başlar.\",\"cast\":\"Sonakshi Sinha, Vijay Varma, Gulshan Devaiah, Sohum Shah, Zoa Morani, Jayati Bhatia\",\"director\":\"Zoya Akhtar, Reema Kagti\",\"genre\":\"Suç / Gizem / Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-05-12\",\"release_date\":\"2023-05-12\",\"last_modified\":\"1685204456\",\"rating\":\"6\",\"rating_5based\":\"3\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"201050\",\"episode_run_time\":\"54\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2851,\"name\":\"Wild Isles\",\"series_id\":6251,\"cover\":\"http://mxb001.black-pars.com:8080/images/series/2IQm2H0D9rkJCziGZrEcPROWUhI_small.jpg\",\"plot\":\"This nature documentary introduces viewers to the fauna and flora of Britain and Ireland across four main areas: woodlands, grasslands, freshwater and marine.\",\"cast\":\"David Attenborough\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Documentary\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-12\",\"release_date\":\"2023-03-12\",\"last_modified\":\"1694118624\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"C-KcTje9sMk\",\"tmdb\":\"208230\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"350\",\"category_ids\":[350]},{\"num\":2852,\"name\":\"Greek Salad\",\"series_id\":6248,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/jYWqzYQIl4aGuDOciSp8g2H3eWF.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Takes place twenty years after the events of “L’Auberge Espanole,” and follows Tom and Mia, the children of the film’s protagonists Xavier and Wendy, as they spend time in Athens.\",\"cast\":\"Aliocha Schneider, Megan Northam, Romain Duris, Cécile de France, Fotinì Peluso, Kevin Bishop, Kelly Reilly, Barnaby Metschurat\",\"director\":\"Cédric Klapisch\",\"genre\":\"Drama / Comedy\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-14\",\"release_date\":\"2023-04-14\",\"last_modified\":\"1685212016\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"121459\",\"episode_run_time\":\"52\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2853,\"name\":\"Dead Ringers\",\"series_id\":6247,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/3GZB7pnyAw6QV053TwxiqvRyOw3.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Elliot and Beverly Mantle are twins who share everything: drugs, lovers, and an unapologetic desire to do whatever it takes — including pushing the boundaries on medical ethics — in an effort to challenge antiquated practices and bring women’s healthcare to the forefront.\",\"cast\":\"Rachel Weisz, Britne Oldford, Poppy Liu, Jennifer Ehle, Michael Chernus, Emily Meade, Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine, Jennean Farmer\",\"director\":\"Alice Birch\",\"genre\":\"Mystery / Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-04-20\",\"release_date\":\"2023-04-20\",\"last_modified\":\"1685212096\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"lZNUmNDjINg\",\"tmdb\":\"130987\",\"episode_run_time\":\"60\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2854,\"name\":\"Citadel (2023) TR\",\"series_id\":6223,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/5MHtxPEfmN4b0rHzfEZRcm6v9WI.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Sekiz yıl önce, küresel bir bağımsız gizli servis olan Citadel yeni bir örgüt olan Manticore tarafından yok edilir. Hafızaları silinen elit ajanlar Mason Kane ve Nadia Sinh canlarını zor kurtarırlar. Sekiz yıl sonra, Mason\'ın eski meslektaşı Bernard Orlick ondan Manticore\'un yeni bir dünya düzeni kurmasını önlemek için yardım talep eder.\",\"cast\":\"Richard Madden, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Ashleigh