ittany O\'Grady, Nat Wolff\",\"director\":\"Tony Basgallop\",\"genre\":\"Comedy / Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-23\",\"release_date\":\"2023-02-23\",\"last_modified\":\"1678542026\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"0vPPWWE5gHE\",\"tmdb\":\"139099\",\"episode_run_time\":\"30\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2865,\"name\":\"The Head of Joaquín Murrieta (MX)\",\"series_id\":5929,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/szYenUSJozmEF9Bsc96mtfirix.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Greed took over California because of the gold rush. It made people thirsty for wealth and land. There, in the newly drawn border between Mexico and the US, a lawless war for control, fueled by the anger and xenophobia of the past war, is led by a group of immigrants who join forces to create the myth of the Latin Robin Hood: Joaquín Murrieta.\",\"cast\":\"Juan Manuel Bernal, Steve Wilcox, Alejandro Speitzer, Becky Zhu Wu, Gus Carr, Yoshira Escárrega, Emiliano Zurita, Andrew Leland Rogers\",\"director\":\"Mauricio Leiva-Cock, Diego Ramírez Schrempp\",\"genre\":\"Drama / Western / Action & Adventure\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-17\",\"release_date\":\"2023-02-17\",\"last_modified\":\"1678541018\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"BQ8_PjFrJ4A\",\"tmdb\":\"135502\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2866,\"name\":\"The Kids in the Hall (CA)\",\"series_id\":5927,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/cy5WLoE5QvyWAqOpaAytq70Xyvp.jpg\",\"plot\":\"The iconic Canadian sketch comedy show returns with an exciting new season, a fresh batch of fun, off-beat characters and beloved favorites, and sketches that pack a satirical punch, all laced with the edgy and fearless comedy the Kids are synonymous for.\",\"cast\":\"Dave Foley, Bruce McCulloch, Kevin McDonald, Mark McKinney, Scott Thompson\",\"director\":\"Dave Foley, Mark McKinney, Kevin McDonald\",\"genre\":\"Comedy\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-12\",\"release_date\":\"2022-05-12\",\"last_modified\":\"1678540507\",\"rating\":\"6\",\"rating_5based\":\"3\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"zm2rAjmH_JQ\",\"tmdb\":\"199918\",\"episode_run_time\":\"25\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2867,\"name\":\"The Pimp – No F***ing Fairytale (DE)\",\"series_id\":5917,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/kw5UkrJQIC5X2UPJfzcFBFW2Z66.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Inspired by true events, the gangster epic LUDEN tells the rise of the Nutella Gang, the most famous pimp cartel in Hamburg\'s legendary Reeperbahn during the 1980s. The unusual cartel turns the rough red-light district in St. Pauli into a glamourous place, but it is also the beginning of a power struggle with the established pimps of the GMBH.\",\"cast\":\"Lena Urzendowsky, Noah Tinwa, Karsten Antonio Mielke, Stefan Konarske, Lara Feith\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-03\",\"release_date\":\"2023-03-03\",\"last_modified\":\"1678538557\",\"rating\":\"6\",\"rating_5based\":\"3\",\"backdrop_path\":[],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"221483\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2868,\"name\":\"Farzi (IN)\",\"series_id\":5912,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w154/cTS86RwEBIDgCgUmjWQTSoPsK6p.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Sunny, a brilliant small-time artist is catapulted into the high-stakes world of counterfeiting when he creates the perfect fake currency note, even as Michael, a fiery, unorthodox task force officer wants to rid the country of the counterfeiting menace. In this thrilling cat-and-mouse race, losing is not an option!\",\"cast\":\"Shahid Kapoor, Vijay Sethupathi, Kay Kay Menon, Raashii Khanna, Bhuvan Arora, Chittaranjan Giri, Amol Palekar, Zakir Hussain\",\"director\":\"Krishna D.K., Raj Nidimoru\",\"genre\":\"Drama / Crime\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-10\",\"release_date\":\"2023-02-10\",\"las