ack, his online information altered to implicate him as having masterminded a cyber-attack on Berlin resulting in a city-wide blackout. Suspected as a terrorist, Lukas scrambles to find out why he\'s been targeted, as even his family and friends begin to doubt his innocence.\",\"cast\":\"Matthias Schweighöfer, Tom Beck, Edin Hasanović, Alexandra Maria Lara\",\"director\":\"Matthias Schweighöfer\",\"genre\":\"Drama, Mystery\",\"releaseDate\":\"2017-03-17\",\"release_date\":\"2017-03-17\",\"last_modified\":\"1669035155\",\"rating\":\"6\",\"rating_5based\":\"3\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zvetcfsCjU39OKeBluGUm2CMbg6.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"mQWt6KM121I\",\"tmdb\":\"70048\",\"episode_run_time\":\"46\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2900,\"name\":\"Hunters\",\"series_id\":5565,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/vJlr9hIwtQzgIxKQf6ic3dMJKlF.jpg\",\"plot\":\"A diverse band of Nazi Hunters living in 1977 New York City discover that hundreds of high ranking Nazi officials are living among us and conspiring to create a Fourth Reich in the U.S. The eclectic team of Hunters set out on a bloody quest to bring the Nazis to justice and thwart their new genocidal plans.\",\"cast\":\"Logan Lerman, Al Pacino, Jerrika Hinton, Saul Rubinek, Carol Kane\",\"director\":\"Jordan Peele, Nelson McCormick\",\"genre\":\"Crime, Drama\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-02-20\",\"release_date\":\"2020-02-20\",\"last_modified\":\"1673955073\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mmI8JQJ9Du1hUNFS1iFKv2ltlz3.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"SCu0hOOw3aQ\",\"tmdb\":\"79622\",\"episode_run_time\":\"60\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2901,\"name\":\"Star Trek: Picard (2020) TR\",\"series_id\":2060,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/nIlAKIrLKxOeoEnc0Urb65yNCp.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Jean-Luc Picard, Yıldız Filosu\'ndan emekli olduktan 14 yıl sonra Chateau Picard\'da sakin bir hayat yaşar. Ancak onun huzurlu yaşamı, Dahj adındaki esrarengiz gizemli bir kadın tarafından arandığında yarım kalır. Picard, yardımına ihtiyaç duyan Dahj\'ın sorununu araştırmaya başladığında Dahj\'ın, kendi geçmişiyle bağlantısı olabileceğini anlar ve kendi geçmişiyle yüzleşmek zorunda kalır.\",\"cast\":\"Patrick Stewart, Jeri Ryan, Michelle Hurd, Ed Speleers\",\"director\":\"Alex Kurtzman, Kirsten Beyer, Akiva Goldsman\",\"genre\":\"Bilim Kurgu & Fantazi / Aksiyon & Macera / Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-01-23\",\"release_date\":\"2020-01-23\",\"last_modified\":\"1787748646\",\"rating\":\"7\",\"rating_5based\":\"3.5\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lodNd9ITHf32q8ybHArHqoWOcXf.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/mK286PAkhgLJqk5cO0BCmFLkNE7.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/u9eaoVrvPd921vCqaHY8gtfnKFp.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qYNdiirYXMoz19feBIMiqRcigYy.jpg\",\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qoW5l4C0NrySNBYAkEtCE15BkZB.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"FySrgrKJguE\",\"tmdb\":\"85949\",\"episode_run_time\":\"0\",\"category_id\":\"671\",\"category_ids\":[671]},{\"num\":2902,\"name\":\"Özel İlişkiler\",\"series_id\":7382,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/8MTaEQ0HoJHiF0TkSMhVZcA5X9c.jpg\",\"plot\":\"1940\'lar, Galiçya. Dedektif ruhu taşııyan üst sınıfa mensup Marina Quiroga, sadık uşağı Hektor\'un yardımıyla şehire dehşet saçan katili tuzağa düşümreye karar verir.\",\"cast\":\"Jean Reno, Aura Garrido, Gorka Otxoa, Pablo Molinero, Álex García\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Komedi, Gizem, Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-16\",\"release_date\":\"2022-09-16\",\"last_modified\":\"1685997391\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/s42RBJH1I9yyRRSdxlUzYmAPgGH.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"112321\",\"episode_run_time\":\"50\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2903,\"nam