ttps://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/iJVgkjFf6TrxDlic97XCkS4fEuc.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"85854\",\"episode_run_time\":\"50\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2915,\"name\":\"Undone\",\"series_id\":7402,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/1RaFZB0qiuTVlCvPSOa8HPo8FN0.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Undone, ölümcül bir kazadan sağ çıkmayı başaran ancak bu kazanın sonrasında, zamanla arasında farklı bir bağın kurulmuş olduğunu fark eden Alma\'nın maceralarını anlatıyor. Zamanda yolculuk edebilen genç Alma, bu gücünü babasının ölümündeki gizemi ortaya çıkarmak için kullanacaktır.\",\"cast\":\"Rosa Salazar, Angelique Cabral, Constance Marie, Siddharth Dhananjay, Bob Odenkirk\",\"director\":\"\",\"genre\":\"Animasyon, Bilim Kurgu & Fantazi, Dram\",\"releaseDate\":\"2019-09-12\",\"release_date\":\"2019-09-12\",\"last_modified\":\"1685997810\",\"rating\":\"8\",\"rating_5based\":\"4\",\"backdrop_path\":[\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4HPRLBGgG0hUZXE0HA98vuWxPCt.jpg\"],\"youtube_trailer\":\"\",\"tmdb\":\"86340\",\"episode_run_time\":\"23\",\"category_id\":\"295\",\"category_ids\":[295]},{\"num\":2916,\"name\":\"Resident Alien (2021) MULTI\",\"series_id\":14041,\"cover\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2/5van3ktOTqWr5lcixh5aR8NlqqW.jpg\",\"plot\":\"Crash-landed alien Harry takes on the identity of a small-town Colorado doctor. Arriving with a secret mission, he starts off living a simple life…but things get a bit rocky when he’s roped into solving a local murder and realizes he needs to assimilate into his new world. As he does, he begins to wrestle with the moral dilemma of his mission and asking the big life questions like: “Are human beings worth saving?” and “Why do they fold their pizza before eating it?”\",\"cast\":\"Alan Tudyk, Sara Tomko, Corey Reynolds, Alice Wetterlund, Levi Fiehler, Elizabeth Bowen, Meredith Garretson, Judah Prehn\",\"director\":\"Chris Sheridan\",\"genre\":\"Sci-Fi & Fantasy\",\"rele